   $$
   103 - 47 = 56
   $$
4. **Bouquets per Flower:** Each bouquet contains 8 flowers.
5. **Calculate Number of Bouquets:**
   $$
   \frac{56}{8} = 7
   $$

Thus, Wendy can make \boxed{7} bouquets. 

