```python
# Roger's initial number of books
initial_books = 25

# Books sold
sold_books = 21

# Books remaining after selling
remaining_books = initial_books - sold_books

# Books bought with the money earned
bought_books = 30

# Total books after selling and buying
total_books = remaining_books + bought_books

total_books
```


