$$
\text{Number of groups} = \frac{54}{6} = 9
$$

Thus, the coach can form $\boxed{9}$ groups. The calculation is confirmed by verifying that 6 players per group multiplied by 9 groups equals the total number of players, ensuring the solution is correct. 

