Another way: 41 + 29. Let me think of 29 as 30 -1. So 41 + 30 is 71, minus 1 is 70. Then 70 - 15 is 55. Still the same. So I think 55 is correct. 

No, I don't think I made any mistakes here. The total before deletion is 70, subtract 15, get 55. So the answer is 55.
