To determine how much money Will made over the two days, we need to calculate his earnings for each day separately and then sum them.

- On **Monday**, Will worked 8 hours at a rate of $8 per hour:
  $$
  8 \, \text{hours} \times 8 \, \text{\$/hour} = 64 \, \text{\$}
  $$

- On **Tuesday**, Will worked 2 hours at the same rate:
  $$
  2 \, \text{hours} \times 8 \, \text{\$/hour} = 16 \, \text{\$}
  $$

Now, summing the earnings for both days:
$$
